"Color of the do not disturb indicator appearing next to team members "
"names in the direct messages list."
msgstr ""
"개인 메시지 목록에서 팀 구성원 이름 옆에 표시되는 방해 금지 표시의 색상입니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme.rst:234
msgid "Mention Jewel BG"
msgstr "Mention Jewel BG"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme.rst:235
msgid ""
"Background color of the jewel indicating unread mentions that appears to "
"the right of the channel name. This is also the background color of the "
"“Unread Posts Below/Above” indicator appearing at the top or bottom of "
"the Channels pane on shorter browser windows."
msgstr ""
"채널 이름 오른쪽에 표시되어 읽지 않은 멘션을 나타내는 표식의 배경색입니다. 이는 "
"짧은 브라우저 창에서 Channels 창 위나 아래에 표시되는 \"Unread Posts "
"Below/Above\" 표시의 배경색이기도 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme.rst:236
msgid "Mention Jewel Text"
msgstr "Mention Jewel Text"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-theme.rst:237
msgid ""
"Text color on the mention jewel indicating the number of unread mentions."
